@url = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwiaWF0IjoxNzk0ODY0NTU2LCJleHAiOjE3OTQ4Nzg5NTZ9.o0qQfno999aTLFBeh9wLTO9Hv_P_9blifmMPx341ZII

### Crear viaje (OK)
POST {{url}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehiculo_id": 2, "conductor_id": 1, "fecha_salida": "2026-11-10T08:00", "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-10T14:00", "origen": "La Rioja", "destino": "Córdoba", "kilometros": 450, "observaciones": "Sin novedades" }

### Historial completo
GET {{url}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial por vehículo
GET {{url}}/viajes?vehiculo_id=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial por conductor
GET {{url}}/viajes?conductor_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Total de km por conductor
GET {{url}}/viajes/km?conductor_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Total de km por vehículo
GET {{url}}/viajes/km?vehiculo_id=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Error 403 (licencia vencida)
POST {{url}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehiculo_id": 2, "conductor_id": 2, "fecha_salida": "2026-11-10T08:00", "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-10T14:00", "origen": "La Rioja", "destino": "Córdoba", "kilometros": 450 }

### Error 400 (llegada anterior a salida)
POST {{url}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehiculo_id": 2, "conductor_id": 1, "fecha_salida": "2026-11-10T14:00", "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-10T08:00", "origen": "A", "destino": "B", "kilometros": 10 }

### Error 404 (vehículo inexistente)
POST {{url}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehiculo_id": 9999, "conductor_id": 1, "fecha_salida": "2026-11-10T08:00", "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-10T14:00", "origen": "A", "destino": "B", "kilometros": 10 }

### Error 401 (sin token)
GET {{url}}/viajes